  "details": "Sometimes, immediately after changing avatars, I see a message saying something like \"Changed to (original avatar name),\" which is strange, and then my avatar switches back to the one I was previously using.\n\nThe avatar I attempted to switch to is barely displayed, if at all. Instead, it appears to go through the sequence: original avatar → loading → original avatar. It looks as though the avatar change is triggered twice in rapid succession, causing the corresponding loading process to run twice as well.\n\nThis is a recent issue. It doesn't happen all the time, but it occurs occasionally. It happens regardless of whether I change avatars using the in-game Wing Menu, the main menu, or via OSC.\n\nI'm using the Unity 6 version, but this feels more like a networking issue than a Unity-specific one, so I'm submitting it as a regular Bug Report.",
